% PowerPoint slides 10.
### ParseStatement_While()
% The source slide is code-only; the heading names the function.
[function] @(84, 166) {$code, size=25px} ```cpp
ASTNode ParseStatement_While() {
  lexer.Use(Lexer::ID_WHILE);
  lexer.Use('(');
  ASTNode condition = ParseStatement_Expression();
  lexer.Use(')');
  ASTNode body = ParseStatement();
  return ASTNode{"WHILE", condition, body};
}
```
